1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,711
Speaking, task three. Story number 1: Moving house. What did the Novák family do yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,425
What did the Novák family do yesterday?

3
00:00:34,133 --> 00:00:36,931
Yesterday the Novák family moved to a new flat.

4
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:39,167
In the morning they packed everything into boxes.

5
00:00:39,367 --> 00:00:42,100
Mum packed the dishes and the children packed the toys.

6
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:44,067
Then a big van arrived.

7
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:47,233
Two strong men carried the boxes and furniture to the van.

8
00:00:47,433 --> 00:00:49,900
It was hard, but it went quickly.

9
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:52,789
In the new flat they put the sofa and the table in place.

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,228
Dad put the beds together and Mum cleaned the kitchen.

11
00:00:56,433 --> 00:00:58,400
In the evening everyone was very tired.

12
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,967
They had no time to cook, so they ordered pizza.

13
00:01:01,167 --> 00:01:03,667
They ate it on the floor between the boxes and laughed.

14
00:01:03,867 --> 00:01:12,197
Tell story 1 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
